# KelyfOS — base flavor.
#
# BusyBox and musl and nothing else. No TLS client, no interpreters, no package
# manager. This is the flavor for running a known binary under supervision, and
# its value is precisely what it does not contain.
#
# 64 MiB is a ceiling on what the guest may write to the rootfs image, not a
# cost: the file is sparse and occupies about 5 MiB.
BR2_TARGET_ROOTFS_EXT2_SIZE="64M"
